SumoBot Specs:

Microcontroller: ESP32

Motors: 12V 580RPM 3.5 kgf.cm HP DC Gear Motor
Motor Driver: Cytron MDD10A dual-channel 30V / 10A motor controller
Wheels: 3mm outer diameter silicone

Battery: Lipo Battery 3S 11.1V 60C RC Battery 2250 mAh
DC Buck Converter: LM2596s

Opponent Detection Sensors: Sharp GP2Y0A41SK0F Analog Distance Sensor 4-30cm
Edge Sensors: QTR-1RC Reflectance Sensor

16 AWG Wire for motor connections
18 AWG Wire for microcontroller connections
